8
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.600
we're going to make it with salmon.

9
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.600
So fresh salmon that we've cubed.

10
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.050 line:15%
So you have a skillet, Drew, with some olive oil in it?

11
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.540 line:15%
I do. And it seems like

12
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.300 line:15%
it's a really good temperature right now,

13
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.880 line:15%
and also Kim, Julie, and Precious are incredible BFFs

14
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.380
