15
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.943
They all made this dish ahead of time-

16
00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:31.890
Oh good!

17
00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.610
and they might have some questions

18
00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:35.197
to pop in here and there, Giada-

19
00:00:35.197 --> 00:00:36.030 line:15%
Oh amazing!

20
00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:36.863 line:15%
if that's okay.

21
00:00:36.863 --> 00:00:39.644 line:15%
Oh, I love it. Yes, yes, yes, yes.

22
00:00:39.644 --> 00:00:40.685 line:15%
Giada, I made this-

23
00:00:40.685 --> 00:00:42.310 line:15%
Giada, I do have a question about the fish.

24
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:43.480
Sure.

25
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.480
I'm severely allergic to shellfish

26
00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.740 line:15%
and I noticed this recipe was done with salmon,

27
00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:50.140 line:15%
