60
00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.933
So I've got some cherry tomatoes that I just have.

61
00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.090
So we're going to create this really light sort of-

62
00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:16.090
think Amalfi coast, think really light tomato sauce

63
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.680
like from fresh tomatoes.

64
00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.920
So now the tomatoes are breaking down

65
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.560
