66
00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:22.930
Yep. Absolutely.

67
00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:23.763
Yeah?

68
00:02:23.763 --> 00:02:25.080
They're looking really, really, really good.

69
00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.750
Are you ready to add a little bit of wine?

70
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:27.920
We're not going to add a lot of wine.

71
00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.870
Just a little hint to give it extra flavor.

72
00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.480
And that's the great thing about these recipes.

73
00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.870
It's not that I've taken everything out of it.

74
00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.730
I've just reduced the amounts a little bit

75
00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:41.250
