76
00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.910
There we go. It adds a little acidity to the tomatoes

77
00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:47.500
which creates a really well balanced sauce in the end.

78
00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.134
So a little bit of white wine.

79
00:02:49.134 --> 00:02:51.670
Giada, I have a question as you're stirring your pasta.

80
00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.130
