82
00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.640
but what about a plant-based pasta? Like a chickpea pasta?

83
00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.473
Good question.

84
00:02:59.473 --> 00:03:02.510
Sure! If you like chickpea pasta, that'd be great.

85
00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.423
Lentil pasta is really great.

86
00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:10.150
There's edamame pastas now that work really well as well.

87
00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.230
Okay, thank you.

88
00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.110
You guys ready to add some olives?

89
00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.390
I just added my olives.

90
00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:17.480
We're also going to add the parsley, the chopped parsley-

91
00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.313
Got it.

92
00:03:18.313 --> 00:03:19.916
and the oregano. So again reinforcing-

93
00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:22.030
Giada, I have a question.

94
00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:23.430
Yeah, sure.

95
00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.090
So I'm not big on olives. I didn't add that many,

96
00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:28.620
