97
00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.340
No. You, you can reduce the olives

98
00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.650
if you don't like the olives.

99
00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.760
It's just this is a traditional dish

100
00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:36.360
