101
00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.020
that salty rich olive

102
00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:41.280
with the light vibrant flavor of tomato.

103
00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.636
But you could use capers or use less. Yeah, yeah.

104
00:03:44.636 --> 00:03:46.090
Sounds good. Thank you!

105
00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:49.430
Yeah, yeah. I don't want to forget about my pasta here.

106
00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.703
