113
00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.210
Yep.

114
00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:09.510
No, I just take this nifty little pasta scooper.

115
00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.340
This colander that's like a spoon,

116
00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:12.940
