119
00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.830
So you don't drain it.

120
00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.840
You throw the pastor right into the skillet.

121
00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:21.673
Oops.

122
00:04:22.814 --> 00:04:24.700
