134
00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:54.660
So it kind of depends, but you want it to be saucy.

135
00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.924
So I just use two ladlefuls.

136
00:04:56.924 --> 00:04:59.390
So that's going to be, well, I used one ladleful.

137
00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:00.610
So that's gonna be about a quarter cup.

138
00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.709
So I might use one more, so up to half a cup.

139
00:05:03.709 --> 00:05:05.770
Yep. I wouldn't use more than a half a cup.

140
00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.130
You shouldn't need to.

141
00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:10.113
And then I finish it with a little bit of Parmesan cheese.

142
00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.663
Parmigiano.

143
00:05:12.663 --> 00:05:13.680
Looks wonderful.

144
00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:18.680
Parmigiano! And allow the cheese to slowly get mixed in

145
00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.560
